<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,366 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,366 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 5,366 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,363 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 6		  Sept 5</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,366		   5,363</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	9.81		    7.01</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
